  "notes": "Restores validate_habitat_patch.py and validate_suitability_model.py after #4772 made the shared runner reject permissive placeholder object schemas. Each schema now declares exactly the optional fields its validator already enforced (connectivity_edge_refs/corridor_refs; model_card_ref), and each validator runs its domain check before the schema so the existing, more specific messages still come first. Docs, fixture notes and test docstrings that described the schemas as empty are updated."
